// PROFITS: Perpetual's framework for how investable a country is for renewable energy,
// seen the way an investor would. Seven pillars, each scored 1–5, then weighted.
//
// Country scores: an indicator-based baseline (data/policy-scores.ts, generated by
// scripts/build-profits.mjs), replaced country by country with researched scores below.

